sequenceDiagram
%% name: module-descriptor-runtime-load
%% PROUVE : rien encore pour la sequence (flux modules-runtime et vfs). Contrats prouves par la fondation :
%%   resolve (tests resolve_*), check_compat (tag_reuse_move_and_unreserved_removal_detected), LiveCatalog
%%   (readers_keep_their_snapshot_across_publication), VfsPath (vfs_path_rejects_dotdot_and_friends).
%% SOURCES LUES : src/server/catalog.rs, src/storage/vfs/mod.rs, crates/this-descriptor/src/{resolve,compat,check}.rs.
%% NON ETABLI : couche de repartition sous charge ; annulation des flux en fin de grace.
    autonumber
    actor Admin
    participant AZ as Autorisation
    participant RT as ModuleRuntime
    participant MS as ModuleStore
    participant RES as resolve
    participant LD as ModuleLoader
    participant CAT as LiveCatalog
    participant DSP as Couche de repartition

    Admin->>AZ: load billing
    AZ->>AZ: politique this.module.load
    alt refus
        AZ-->>Admin: 403 this.auth.forbidden
    end
    AZ->>RT: load Stored billing
    rect rgba(164,139,255,.15)
    Note over RT,MS: Phase 1 - lecture et verification
    RT->>MS: get billing None
    MS->>MS: plus haute version, descriptor.json sans textes
    MS->>MS: check profil Stored
    MS-->>RT: ModuleDescriptor
    end
    rect rgba(164,139,255,.15)
    Note over RT,RES: Phase 2 - resolution fail-closed
    RT->>RES: candidats vs modules actifs
    alt dependance, version, cycle, doublon, reference
        RES-->>RT: Vec ContractError this.module.*
        RT-->>Admin: Failed, rien n'est publie
    else ok
        RES-->>RT: ordre topologique
    end
    end
    rect rgba(164,139,255,.15)
    Note over RT,DSP: Phase 3 - un seul store atomique
    RT->>LD: load source
    LD-->>RT: ModuleInterface
    RT->>RT: envelopper les createurs ValidatingCreator
    RT->>CAT: publish HostCatalog generation+1
    Note over CAT,DSP: REST, GraphQL, gRPC, liens, autorisation lisent le meme instantane
    RT-->>Admin: Active
    end
    Admin->>RT: unload billing
    alt dependants actifs
        RT-->>Admin: this.module.has_dependents, reste Active
    else aucun
        RT->>CAT: publish sans billing
        DSP-->>Admin: nouvelles requetes 503 this.module.unavailable
        Note over RT: Draining, grace 30 s puis annulation des flux
        RT-->>Admin: Unloaded
    end
